{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioAiCredentialsForm",
  "$description": "The AI provider credentials form every gate embeds below the keyless offer: a key, a model, an endpoint, and the two buttons that keep or abandon them. Everything here is a projection — `ui/ai-credentials-form.ts` keeps the drafts, decides what a fetch is sent with, what Save actually persists and whether Cancel is on offer at all. This document never reads a setting and never calls the proxy.",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "ai-creds-form",
    "role": "group",
    "aria-label": "AI provider key"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "The seven `.ai-creds*` rules from `styles/shell.css`, keyed on `part` and repaired on the way. Three of them read `--spectrum-font-size-50`, which resolves only inside `<sp-theme>`; this document is mounted into a plain host inside the gate, outside that element, so each would silently have taken its hard-coded 11px fallback. The 10px column gap comes onto the kit's spacing scale at 8px, which is also what the extra row below now wants.",
    "display": "flex",
    "flexDirection": "column",
    "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
    "width": "100%",
    "maxWidth": "320px",
    "textAlign": "left",
    "& [part=\"title\"]": {
      "$description": "Centred over a left-aligned column: the form is a titled block, not a list of labelled rows.",
      "alignSelf": "center",
      "fontWeight": "600"
    },
    "& [part=\"note\"]": {
      "$description": "Where the key goes and where it does not. Quiet, because it is reassurance rather than instruction.",
      "margin": "0",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    },
    "& [part=\"label\"]": {
      "$description": "The one group heading in the column — the model field and the list beside it are one choice made two ways.",
      "marginTop": "var(--jx-space-2)",
      "fontWeight": "500",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    },
    "& [part=\"key\"], & [part=\"model\"], & [part=\"endpoint\"], & [part=\"model-list\"]": {
      "$description": "Every control takes the column's width; the kit's fields are inline-flex by default.",
      "width": "100%"
    },
    "& [part=\"models\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)"
    },
    "& [part=\"models-error\"]": {
      "$description": "Why the listing did not finish, beside the button that would try it again. Named `models-error` rather than `error` because the kit's own fields render a permanent `[part=\"error\"]` region of their own, and a surface that reused the name would be addressing three empty paragraphs before it reached its own.",
      "color": "var(--danger)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    },
    "& [part=\"actions\"]": {
      "$description": "Buttons at the end of the column, in the order a dismissal precedes a commitment.",
      "display": "flex",
      "alignSelf": "flex-end",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "title"
      },
      "textContent": "AI provider key"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "note"
      },
      "textContent": "${state.intro}"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-textfield",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "key"
      },
      "$props": {
        "label": "AI provider key",
        "type": "password",
        "size": "sm",
        "placeholder": "sk-… or any compatible key",
        "value": {
          "$ref": "#/state/keyDraft"
        }
      },
      "oninput": {
        "$prototype": "Function",
        "body": [
          {
            "operator": "call",
            "target": {
              "$ref": "#/state/setKey"
            },
            "value": [
              {
                "$ref": "event#/target/value"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "label"
      },
      "textContent": "Model"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-textfield",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "model"
      },
      "$props": {
        "label": "Model ID",
        "size": "sm",
        "placeholder": "Model ID (e.g. gpt-4o, claude-sonnet-4-20250514, etc.)",
        "value": {
          "$ref": "#/state/modelDraft"
        }
      },
      "oninput": {
        "$prototype": "Function",
        "body": [
          {
            "operator": "call",
            "target": {
              "$ref": "#/state/setModel"
            },
            "value": [
              {
                "$ref": "event#/target/value"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "model-list-slot",
        "role": "none"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/hasModels"
      },
      "cases": {
        "true": {
          "$description": "The listed catalogue, as a second way to say what the field above already holds. It was one `sp-combobox`, and the kit has no combobox — so rather than trade the free-text field for a closed list (a self-hosted id is the normal case, and typing one is why the field exists), the two halves are two controls bound to ONE draft. Picking a row writes the field; typing an id the catalogue does not list leaves the control showing it, because a select whose value matches no option synthesises the row rather than lying about what it holds.",
          "tagName": "jx-select",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "model-list"
          },
          "$props": {
            "label": "Listed models",
            "size": "sm",
            "options": {
              "$ref": "#/state/modelOptions"
            },
            "value": {
              "$ref": "#/state/modelDraft"
            }
          },
          "onchange": {
            "$prototype": "Function",
            "body": [
              {
                "operator": "call",
                "target": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/setModel"
                },
                "value": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "models"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-button",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "fetch"
          },
          "$props": {
            "size": "sm",
            "disabled": {
              "$ref": "#/state/modelsLoading"
            }
          },
          "onclick": {
            "$prototype": "Function",
            "body": [
              {
                "operator": "call",
                "target": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/fetchModels"
                },
                "value": []
              }
            ]
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "span",
              "textContent": "${state.fetchLabel}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "error-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/hasError"
          },
          "cases": {
            "true": {
              "tagName": "span",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "models-error",
                "role": "status"
              },
              "textContent": "${state.modelsError}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-textfield",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "endpoint"
      },
      "$props": {
        "label": "Endpoint",
        "size": "sm",
        "placeholder": "Endpoint (optional, e.g. http://localhost:11434/v1)",
        "value": {
          "$ref": "#/state/baseUrlDraft"
        }
      },
      "oninput": {
        "$prototype": "Function",
        "body": [
          {
            "operator": "call",
            "target": {
              "$ref": "#/state/setBaseUrl"
            },
            "value": [
              {
                "$ref": "event#/target/value"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "actions"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "cancel-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/haveKey"
          },
          "cases": {
            "true": {
              "$description": "Only offered once a key exists: with nothing stored there is nothing to go back to, and a Cancel that abandons an empty form to an empty form is a button that does nothing.",
              "tagName": "jx-button",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "cancel"
              },
              "$props": {
                "size": "sm"
              },
              "onclick": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/cancel"
                    },
                    "value": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "textContent": "Cancel"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-button",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "save"
          },
          "$props": {
            "size": "sm",
            "variant": "accent"
          },
          "onclick": {
            "$prototype": "Function",
            "body": [
              {
                "operator": "call",
                "target": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/save"
                },
                "value": []
              }
            ]
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "span",
              "textContent": "Save"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
